<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>O hope of glory, our Christ will return!</l><l>The old creation will vanish away,</l><l>No more we’ll groan, but have full liberty.</l><l>Enjoy salvation in its utmost way.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>O hope of glory, our Christ will return!</l><l>Over the nations with Him we will reign,</l><l>Priests we will be in His presence to serve,</l><l>Thus His salvation in fulness we’ll gain.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>O hope of glory, our Christ will return!</l><l>Waiting and watching, we faithfully serve,</l><l>Running the race, pressing on toward the goal</l><l>That we the Kingdom’s reward might deserve.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
